{"area_id":"eros-2026-03","cached_at":"2026-11-11T18:27:26.421Z","calibration":[{"detector":1,"n_pairs":19,"sigma_sys":0.0484,"source":"stars","visit":1},{"detector":4,"n_pairs":10,"sigma_sys":0.0492,"source":"stars","visit":1},{"detector":1,"n_pairs":13,"sigma_sys":0.0496,"source":"stars","visit":2},{"detector":4,"n_pairs":17,"sigma_sys":0.0352,"source":"stars","visit":2}],"computed_at":"2026-11-12T08:59:13.327Z","method":{"formulas":{"bounds":"rho_max(r) = r_max (1 + G(lambda_L, r)); G = largest NEATM thermal / reflected flux at lambda_L over p_V in [pv_min, pv_max] and eta in [eta_min, eta_max]; NEATM with emissivity, A = phase_integral p_V, the same phase angle in both terms, HG phase function (G = hg_g) for the reflected term, F_sun = pi B_nu(5778 K) (R_sun / au)^2 / r^2","calibration":"per visit and detector: stars (label star, snr >= star_snr_min) matched within star_match_arcsec between consecutive exposures; sigma_sys = 1.4826 MAD(F_b / F_a - 1); fewer than star_pairs_min pairs: sigma_sys_default","colour":"per exposure, every short-arm point with every long-arm point: rho = (F_L / F_S) / (F_sun(L) / F_sun(S)); (sigma_rho / rho)^2 = (s_L / F_L)^2 + (s_S / F_S)^2 + sigma_sys_S^2 + sigma_sys_L^2; lower limit when F_S < snr_min s_S and F_L >= limit_snr_min s_L: rho > F_L / (max(F_S, 0) + limit_sigma s_S) / (F_sun ratio); upper limit the reverse","distance":"u_inv_au > 0: Delta = 1/u, r = |S + Delta s|, S = minus the geocentric Sun (Astronomical Almanac low-precision formula) at the middle of the track's times, s the unit vector to its mean RA/Dec; otherwise r = R_earth sin(elongation) for an elongation below 90 deg, else R_earth (the closest the line of sight comes to the Sun)","points":"a dot of the track with snr >= snr_min is a point; arm = short if wavelength_um < dichroic_um, else long","rel":"(F / F_sun(lambda)) / median over the visit's short-arm points of (F / F_sun); null for a visit with no short-arm point","steps":"per visit and detector, consecutive points in time: c = F_b / F_a - 1; allowed = spin + sqrt(2) sigma_sys + slope_arm |ln(lambda_b / lambda_a)| + step_sigma sigma_c, spin = 0.921 2 pi a_max_mag dt / p_min_h; ok when |c| <= allowed","verdict":"first that applies: flickers (a step not ok); too_blue (a pair with rho + pair_sigma sigma_rho < r_min, or an upper limit below r_min); too_red (parallax, a pair with rho - pair_sigma sigma_rho > rho_max, or a lower limit above rho_max); very_red (worst case, a pair with rho - pair_sigma sigma_rho > r_max, or a lower limit above r_max); rock (a pair with rho / sigma_rho >= informative_snr); too_faint (pairs, none informative); one_colour (no pair). heat_glow: parallax rock with a pair rho > r_max"},"settings":{"a_max_mag":1.0,"dichroic_um":2.42,"emissivity":0.9,"eta_max":2.0,"eta_min":0.7,"hg_g":0.15,"informative_snr":3.0,"limit_sigma":2.0,"limit_snr_min":5.0,"p_min_h":2.2,"pair_sigma":2.0,"phase_integral":0.39,"pv_max":0.5,"pv_min":0.03,"r_max":3.0,"r_min":0.6,"sigma_sys_default":0.06,"slope_long":15.0,"slope_short":4.0,"snr_min":3.0,"spectrum_version":"spectrum-1","star_match_arcsec":4.0,"star_pairs_min":10,"star_snr_min":30.0,"step_sigma":3.0,"sun_sha256":"14978ddb2256c1072b91e7531460d68bd56a56d1b8547204b0563136c2b19a3d"},"spectrum_version":"spectrum-1","sun":{"join_um":2.5,"sha256":"14978ddb2256c1072b91e7531460d68bd56a56d1b8547204b0563136c2b19a3d","source":"sun_reference_stis_002.fits (https://archive.stsci.edu/hlsps/reference-atlases/cdbs/current_calspec/sun_reference_stis_002.fits); sun_mod_001.fits (https://archive.stsci.edu/hlsps/reference-atlases/cdbs/current_calspec/sun_mod_001.fits)"}},"missing":[],"provenance":{"calibration":{"formula":"per visit and detector: stars (label star, snr >= star_snr_min) matched within star_match_arcsec between consecutive exposures; sigma_sys = 1.4826 MAD(F_b / F_a - 1); fewer than star_pairs_min pairs: sigma_sys_default","source":"stars of the area's /dots","tag":"derived"},"colour":{"assumption":"the solar colour of t